								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Traffic Architect is a road builder and traffic-management game. Build and transform the infrastructure network of a self-growing, fully simulated city, where every new building sends fresh trips onto your roads: people driving to work, trucks making deliveries.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every traffic jam has a cause. You provide the creative fix: a few more lanes, a retimed signal, an extra road link, or a whole new highway with an interchange where the crossing used to be. Build it and watch the traffic flow.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >And when more asphalt stops working, build a public transport network. A bus line with bus-only lanes, a rail link or a metro tunnel placed where people already travel fills up fast, and every rider is one less car in your junction. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.poster.avif?t=1792593337" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.webm?t=1792593337" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.mp4?t=1792593337" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Design the network</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Upgrade roads through 11 tiers, from gravel tracks to boulevards and multi-lane highways</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Cross rivers with bridges and mountains with tunnels in one simple move</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Rebuild a jammed crossing as a full interchange in one click: 3-way compact or trumpet where three meet, a compact or wide cloverleaf where two roads cross</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Shape the flow with one-way streets, turn restrictions and per-junction rules, then tune the traffic lights phase by phase</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.poster.avif?t=1792593337" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.webm?t=1792593337" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.mp4?t=1792593337" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Traffic simulated car by car</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every vehicle is simulated. Follow a single car across town and see the jam from inside it</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >The people using your network report back, a smooth run, a long wait or a detour twice the direct distance, and a congestion heat map shows where the network hurts</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Over two dozen live metrics, from queued cars to transit share, each charted across the whole run so you can see what a new interchange did to the numbers</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.poster.avif?t=1792593337" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.webm?t=1792593337" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.mp4?t=1792593337" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Move beyond the car</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Bus lines with routes and stops, plus bus lanes and bus-only roads so your buses don't sit in jams</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Passenger rail and underground metro with stations, level crossings and tunnels. Passengers route across your entire network, bus, rail, metro, transfers included. Build connections, and people will use them</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Freight rides the rails: dedicate lines, connect industry to demand, and the trucks come off your roads. Goods change trains at shared stations the same way passengers do</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.poster.avif?t=1792593337" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.webm?t=1792593337" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.mp4?t=1792593337" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Build it your way</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Traffic Challenges: puzzles where you build the interchanges by hand, one ramp at a time, then test whether enough cars get through</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Creative mode: place buildings yourself, no budget and no way to lose</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Full map editor: sculpt terrain, rivers, mountains and lakes, then play real runs on your own maps and share them on Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Large maps up to 18x18 km, with dense downtown districts and suburban settlements</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.poster.avif?t=1792593337" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.webm?t=1792593337" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028050/extras/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.mp4?t=1792593337" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
